; zlibwapi core exports with legacy ordinals required by cuDNN 8.9.
; Adapted from madler/zlib v1.3.1 contrib/vstudio/vc9/zlibvc.def.
; MiniZip exports are omitted; additional zlib 1.3.2 exports start at 200.
; zlib license: toolchain/zlib-src/zlib-1.3.2/LICENSE (included in package).
